84:      "| Model | Quant | Successes /116 | Answer tasks /25 | Action tasks /91 | Exceptions | Median steps | "
85:      "M5 s/step, median (p10-p90) | Prompt tokens | Output tokens |",
86:      "|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|"]
87: for r in rows:
88:     L.append(f"| {r['label']} | {r['quant']} | {r['successes']} | {r['answer_task_successes']} | "
