86: ## Repository layout
87: 
88: | Path | What it holds |
89: |---|---|
90: | [`analysis/`](analysis/) | Scripts that compute every reported number from `results/` |
91: | [`train/`](train/) | Training code: SFT, GRPO, prompt/action format |
92: | [`data/`](data/) | Dataset builders and fixed split files |
93: | [`eval/`](eval/) | Benchmark harnesses: AndroidControl, AndroidWorld, MobileWorld, general knowledge |
94: | [`scripts/`](scripts/) | Run orchestration, by purpose (AndroidWorld, MobileWorld, training, speed, publishing) |
95: | [`results/`](results/) | Raw results (episode files, predictions) and the summaries computed from them |
96: | [`logs/`](logs/) | Run logs kept as evidence (model servers, emulators, runs, Codex sessions) |
97: | [`docs/`](docs/) | Documentation |
98: 
99: ## Rules this project kept
100: 
101: - **No AndroidWorld data in training:** no AndroidWorld tasks, variants, trajectories or checkers in any training set.
102: - **Matched primary comparison:** v4 and GUI-Owl get one screenshot, the same tasks and step budget, 4-bit weights
103:   and the installed-app list. Image size and prompts differ ([details](docs/evaluation.md#fairness-at-a-glance)).
104:   MAI-UI runs at 8-bit; v1 gets no app list.
105: - **Sealed held-out seeds:** results of seeds 7/1234/2026 were not read until every model had finished that seed.
106: - **Every deviation is dated** in [docs/PREREG_v4.md](docs/PREREG_v4.md), with what had and had not been seen at the time.
107: - **Exceptions count as failures**, unlike AndroidWorld's default.
