58: Eval loss is on the AndroidControl validation split at the final step.
59: 
60: | Run | Training rows | Steps × rows | LoRA rank, lr | Final eval loss | Where | Run history |
61: |---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
62: | LFM3-VL-2B v1 | 99,216 | 1,250 × 32 | 64, 2e-4 | 0.287 | Modal | Resumed from a checkpoint after ~700 steps |
63: | LFM3-VL-2B v2 | 78,982 | 1,250 × 32 | 64, 2e-4 | 0.299 | Colab | A resume after completion ran one extra step (1,251); eval loss unchanged |
64: | LFM3-VL-2B v3 | 78,952 | 1,250 × 32 | 64, 2e-4 | 0.300 | Modal | One uninterrupted run |
65: | **LFM3-VL-2B v4** | 92,229 | 1,250 × 32 | 64, 2e-4 | 0.306 | Colab A100 | VM lost at step 353; resumed from the step-350 checkpoint |
66: | Qwen3.5-2B v1 | 99,216 | 1,250 × 32 | 64, 2e-4 | 0.240 | Colab | Resumed after ~600 steps |
67: | Qwen3.5-2B v2 | 78,982 | 1,250 × 32 | 64, 2e-4 | 0.250 | Colab | As LFM3 v2 (extra step 1,251) |
