1: # Reproduce
2: 
3: ## Recompute every reported number (minutes, no GPU)
4: 
5: ```bash
6: git clone [EMAIL REDACTED]:alpharomercoma/lfm3-android-runs.git && cd lfm3-android-runs
7: bash analysis/reproduce.sh          # needs Python 3.10+ with numpy; PY=... to pick the interpreter
8: ```
9: 
10: The script re-runs every script in [`analysis/`](../analysis/) and checks each output against the committed version.
11: 
12: | Covered | Not covered |
13: |---|---|
14: | Every summary in `results/`, from episode files, request logs, predictions and per-run metric files | Re-scoring raw AndroidControl / general-knowledge predictions into those metric files (use the `eval/` scorers) |
15: | AndroidWorld analyses without an AndroidWorld install (task metadata is pinned in `data/meta/`) | Training logs, dataset statistics, and the numbers typed into the docs |
16: 
17: | What is regenerated | From |
18: |---|---|
19: | AndroidWorld held-out and seed-30 scores, tests, sensitivity, M5 speed | Episode files (`*.pkl.gz`) in `results/androidworld_sealed/` and `results/androidworld/` |
20: | v4 gate, v4-RL promotion, offline tables | Prediction and metric files in `results/v4_dev/`, `results/v4rl_dev/`, `results/androidcontrol/`, `results/general/` |
21: | Speed (CPU, phones) | Raw request logs in `results/speed/`, `results/qdc/`, `results/devstream/` |
22: | MobileWorld | **Skipped** unless `results/mobileworld/traj_r2/` exists: the 8.6 GB of raw trajectories are not in git; the per-task summaries are |
23: 
24: The episode files are Python pickles written by this project's own AndroidWorld harness. Load them only from this
25: repository.
26: 
27: ## Re-run the experiments
28: 
29: These need hardware and accounts the analysis does not:
30: 
31: | Experiment | Needs | Entry point |
32: |---|---|---|
33: | Training (SFT) | One GPU (peak use ~11.5 GB; runs used Colab A100 / L4 / G4 and Modal A100 / H100); Hugging Face access to the datasets | [`train/sft_vlm.py`](../train/sft_vlm.py); job configs in [`scripts/training/jobs/`](../scripts/training/jobs/) |
34: | AndroidControl offline eval | GPU | [`eval/androidcontrol/generate.py`](../eval/androidcontrol/generate.py) → [`score.py`](../eval/androidcontrol/score.py) |
35: | AndroidWorld | AndroidWorld @ `55ddaf5` cloned to `android_world/` + the two patches in `eval/androidworld/`; Android SDK emulator (API 33); llama.cpp | [`scripts/androidworld/local_sealed_aw_v3.sh`](../scripts/androidworld/local_sealed_aw_v3.sh) `<arm> <seed> <console port> <grpc port> <server port>` |
36: | MobileWorld | A Linux host with KVM; MobileWorld @ `a026188`; a GPU host for the model server | [`scripts/mobileworld/`](../scripts/mobileworld/) |
37: | Speed | llama.cpp `cd959bae9` (b12110); the GGUF files | [`scripts/speed/bench_speed.sh`](../scripts/speed/bench_speed.sh) |
