194: ### Harness notes (disclosed, not corrected)
195: 
196: - **No user simulator:** `ask_user` needs an LLM-backed simulator this setup lacks. GUI-Owl hit it in 7 executions
197:   and MAI-UI in 14. v4 has no such action.
198: - **Typing and Enter cost v4 rounds:** its adapter sends Enter as an extra round after typing. In 3 tasks the
199:   Enter fell on round 50 and was never sent. 37 tasks that hit the budget had fewer than 50 model decisions.
200: - **One task fails for every model:** ThanksgivingPrepTask setup failed on every attempt.
201: - **Discarded runs:** v4's first run (5/105) used an adapter that changed v4's scroll and Enter behaviour, so it is
202:   not counted. GUI-Owl's first run lost its model server after 4 tasks and was discarded.
203: 
204: ---
205: 
206: ## Speed
207: 
208: These are small pilot measurements of each model's full pipeline (agent code + server), not controlled benchmarks.
209: v4 sends far fewer prompt tokens per step (a smaller image) and showed higher prompt throughput in these runs; the
210: tests do not isolate why.
211: 
212: ### CPU (Intel Xeon 2.8 GHz, 8 threads, idle GCP n2-standard-16)
213: 
