FILE scripts/README.md (78 lines)
1: # scripts/
2: 
3: Orchestration: how the runs were launched, watched and published. Scripts that **compute** results are in
4: [`../analysis/`](../analysis/).
5: 
6: Notes:
7: - Most scripts drove a specific machine or cloud session that no longer exists.
8: - Local launchers find the repository from their own location; scripts that run on a VM use that VM's paths.
9: - Superseded versions are kept at tag `archive/pre-restructure-2026-11-20` ([docs/repository.md](../docs/repository.md)).
10: 
11: ## androidworld/ — AndroidWorld runs on the Mac's two emulators
12: 
13: | Script | Does |
14: |---|---|
15: | `local_sealed_aw_v3.sh` | **Runs one held-out arm** (model × seed) with the preregistered flags; results stay sealed |
16: | `local_sealed_aw_v2.sh` | The previous launcher (same flags, unbounded server start); ran the sealed arms started on 2026-11-18 |
17: | `local_sealed_queue.sh` | Queues the remaining held-out arms on one emulator |
18: | `local_aw_rerun.sh` | The preregistered single re-run of setup-crash episodes |
19: | `aw_emu_guard.sh` | Kills a run before a crash is recorded if the emulator stops answering |
20: | `local_aw_queue_v2.sh`, `local_aw_lane.sh` | Queue / resume one emulator's jobs (e.g. after a reboot) |
21: | `pause_sealed_arm.sh` | Pauses a sealed arm so it can resume later |
22: | `local_emu2_fill_v2.sh` | Emulator-2 hand-off: pauses the GUI-Owl seed-1234 arm when v4 is exported, resumes it after v4's seed-30 run |
23: | `local_emu2_fill_v4.sh` | Emulator-2 schedule after that: v4 seed-30 pass → gate → held-out arm → resume the paused arm |
24: | `local_v4_to_aw_v2.sh` | v4 hand-off: merged weights → GGUF → seed-30 run |
25: | `local_lfm3_to_aw.sh`, `local_v2_to_aw.sh`, `local_qwen_to_aw.sh` | Earlier models: wait for weights → GGUF → seed-30 run |
26: | `local_maiui_aw.sh` | MAI-UI-2B seed-30 run (8-bit) |
27: | `local_forcethink_aw.sh`, `local_runtime_ablation_aw.sh` | Inference-only ablations (forced intent, runtime feedback) |
28: | `local_launch_450m_aw.sh`, `local_450m_base_aw.sh` | LFM2.5-VL-450M seed-30 runs |
29: | `aw_watchdog.sh` | Kills hung child processes of a run |
30: 
