36: | `gcp_mw_resume_vm.sh` | **Runs on the VM:** finishes a run under the preregistered completion rule |
37: | `gcp_mw_resume_watch.sh`, `gcp_mw_maiui_watch.sh` | Mac-side watchers: restart the VM / containers and resume after stops or preemptions |
